
# Full-resolution originals pulled from MyHeritage (108 MB). Regenerate with
# The raw GEDCOM carries every living person in full. Never commit it.
# tools/fetch_media.md; web-sized derivatives under site/public/photos are committed.
.DS_Store
node_modules/
photos/hero-original.jpg
photos/line/
site/.astro/
site/dist/
site/public/atlas-data.json
sources/*.ged
sources/media/files/

# A private build directory, so a check never reads a dist another session is
# halfway through writing.
site/dist-verify/
# And the per-session ones kit 2790d85 composes, because a private name that
# everybody shares is not private — `outdir.suggest()` makes one per session,
# so the pattern has to be ignored rather than the literal name. Untracked
# build output in `git status` is how a scoped `git add` picks up somebody
# else's tree, which has happened once in this repo already.
site/dist-*/
